'''Sugar''' is a [[cooking]] ingredient that can be used in a variety of recipes. It can be purchased year round from [[Pierre's General Store]] for {{Price|100}} or from [[JojaMart]] for {{Price|125}}. 4-7 Sugar may occasionally be found in [[Supply Crate]]s on the [[Farm Maps#Beach|Beach Farm]] provided the player has upgraded the [[Farmhouse]] at least once.

Players have the ability to craft Sugar from [[Beet]]s by using a [[Mill]]. Once placed in the mill, one [[Beet]] will make three Sugar. [[Beet]]s placed inside will appear as Sugar in the box beside the [[Mill]] the next morning.

