==Tailoring==
Sugar is used in the spool of the [[2 Willow Lane#Sewing Machine|Sewing Machine]] to create the [[Tailoring|Sugar Shirt]].  [[File:Shirt254.png|24px]]

==Quests==
Sugar is not used in any [[quests]].

==Tips==
*Sugar made using the mill is profitable when using regular or silver quality beets, at {{Price|150}} for 3 sugar it has a higher sell price than 1 beet at regular or silver quality, even with the [[Skills#Farming|Tiller Profession]]. However, this is far less than the {{Price|250}} sell price of beet pickles made using the [[Preserves Jar]].

